  "summary": {
    "attempt_outcome": "Backup DDL/DML completed successfully, but the run was scored as unsuccessful because the observed impact on QPS/p95 did not cross the evaluator’s success thresholds (reward/chain thresholds).",
    "what_worked": [
      "The anomaly executed without SQL errors.",
      "Workload impact was detectable: QPS dropped (16.79 -> 13.69, ~-18%) and p95 rose (22.63ms -> 31.00ms, ~+37%); p99 spiked (38.09ms -> 216.97ms)."
